{"seq":2,"slug":"price-localization-ab-testing","title":"价格本地化、税率换算与试验定价/A-B 测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-in-app-purchase-subscription-revenuecat-engineering/revenue-integrity-price-ops-governance/price-localization-ab-testing","wordCount":2610,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"价格本地化-税率换算与试验定价-a-b-测试\">价格本地化、税率换算与试验定价/A-B 测试</h1><p>同一个 <code>$9.99</code> 在美国是标价，在日本是含消费税的标价，在德国要先扣 19% 增值税再算净价，而在土耳其里拉跌破某个阈值后前一个月的美元收入可能凭空缩水三成。跨境订阅的定价不是一个「填个数字」的后台操作，而是一条从<strong>价格阶梯 → 本地化生成 → 汇率与税档调整 → 灰度生效 → 试验验证</strong>的运营流水线。这条流水线一旦出错，代价不是展示难看，而是老订阅者被强制涨价流失、或含税价算成不含税价后每单亏损几个百分点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-价格阶梯与本地化生成\">核心概念：价格阶梯与本地化生成</h2><p>Apple 与 Google 都不允许你为每个国家自由填一个价格，而是要求价格落在**预定义价格阶梯（price points）**上。Apple 在 2023 年后把可选的美元锚点扩展到数百个价位，并自动为全球 175 个 storefront 生成对应的本地价格，开发者只需选择「基准国家 + 阶梯点位」，Apple 负责换算（<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/manage-app-pricing/\">Apple: Manage app pricing</a>、<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/manage-app-pricing/set-a-price\">Apple: Set a price</a>）。Google Play 则在每个国家划定了每个商品类型的最低/最高价格区间（price range），超出区间无法保存（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/11699445\">Google Play: 商品价格范围</a>）。</p>\n<p>阶梯化带来一个直接后果：<strong>价格不是连续量，而是离散点</strong>。你不能说「德国比美国贵 12%」，只能从阶梯里挑最接近的本地点位。工程上要建立自己的映射表，把「业务目标价」投影到「阶梯可达价」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>App Store</th>\n<th>Google Play</th>\n<th>工程含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基准价</td>\n<td>选定基准 storefront 的阶梯点</td>\n<td>基准国家价格</td>\n<td>定价锚点，通常取美国</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动本地化</td>\n<td>Apple 按阶梯自动生成各 storefront 价格</td>\n<td>Play 自动换算并吸附到本地区间</td>\n<td>关闭后需逐国手工维护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>展示价来源</td>\n<td><code>Product.displayPrice</code>（含本地货币与格式）</td>\n<td><code>ProductDetails.oneTimePurchaseOfferDetails.formattedPrice</code></td>\n<td><strong>永远用商店返回的字符串，绝不自己拼</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>含税语义</td>\n<td>大多数地区为含税价（tax-inclusive）</td>\n<td>多数地区含税，美国等为价外加税</td>\n<td>影响净收入计算，见下节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键纪律只有一条：<strong>客户端展示价格必须渲染商店返回的本地化字符串</strong>（StoreKit 的 <code>displayPrice</code>、Play Billing 的 <code>formattedPrice</code>），而不是 <code>&quot;$&quot; + price.toFixed(2)</code>。自己拼接会在小数点字符（欧洲用逗号）、货币符号位置、含税展示义务三处同时踩雷。RevenueCat 的 Offering/Package 模型把价格透传为 <code>storeProduct.priceString</code>，正是为了让付费墙直接绑定商店价（<a href=\"https://www.revenuecat.com/docs/getting-started/offerings\">RevenueCat: Offerings</a>）。这一层与 <a href=\"../iap-platform-storekit-billing-model/offering-package-entitlement-model\">Offering / Package / Entitlement 三层商品配置模型</a> 是同一套配置：价格属于商店层，Entitlement 只表达访问权。</p>\n<p>下图是定价变更从意图到生效的流水线，中间每一次「换算」都是事故高发点：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[业务意图&lt;br/&gt;目标月费 9.99 USD] --&gt; B[选基准阶梯点&lt;br/&gt;App Store / Play]&#10;    B --&gt; C[自动本地化&lt;br/&gt;生成各 storefront 价]&#10;    C --&gt; D{税档与汇率复核}&#10;    D --&gt;|含税价含 VAT/GST| E[净收入反算&lt;br/&gt;price / 1+taxRate]&#10;    D --&gt;|价外加税地区| F[净收入 = price]&#10;    E --&gt; G[阶梯吸附&lt;br/&gt;取最近可达点]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{灰度策略}&#10;    H --&gt;|新用户| I[立即生效]&#10;    H --&gt;|老订阅者| J[保价窗口&lt;br/&gt;preserve price]&#10;    I --&gt; K[价格 A/B 试验]&#10;    J --&gt; K&#10;    K --&gt; L[显著性判定&lt;br/&gt;样本量 / 贝叶斯后验]&#10;    L --&gt; M[全量 rollout 或回退]\">graph TD\n    A[业务意图&lt;br/&gt;目标月费 9.99 USD] --&gt; B[选基准阶梯点&lt;br/&gt;App Store / Play]\n    B --&gt; C[自动本地化&lt;br/&gt;生成各 storefront 价]\n    C --&gt; D{税档与汇率复核}\n    D --&gt;|含税价含 VAT/GST| E[净收入反算&lt;br/&gt;price / 1+taxRate]\n    D --&gt;|价外加税地区| F[净收入 = price]\n    E --&gt; G[阶梯吸附&lt;br/&gt;取最近可达点]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{灰度策略}\n    H --&gt;|新用户| I[立即生效]\n    H --&gt;|老订阅者| J[保价窗口&lt;br/&gt;preserve price]\n    I --&gt; K[价格 A/B 试验]\n    J --&gt; K\n    K --&gt; L[显著性判定&lt;br/&gt;样本量 / 贝叶斯后验]\n    L --&gt; M[全量 rollout 或回退]</pre><h2 id=\"税率换算-谁是代征方-净收入怎么算\">税率换算：谁是代征方，净收入怎么算</h2><p>大多数司法辖区由 Apple 与 Google 作为 <strong>merchant of record（记录商户）<strong>代你向终端用户收取并代缴 VAT/GST/消费税，你拿到的是</strong>税后、扣佣后</strong>净额（<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/manage-tax-and-banking/overview-of-taxes-and-categories\">Apple: Taxes</a>、<a href=\"https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/10374302\">Google Play: 税务</a>）。这意味着你的定价数字对大多数地区是<strong>含税价</strong>，不是净收入。</p>\n<p>设商店标价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>、该地区综合税率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>（中央 + 地方可能叠加）、平台佣金率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，则每笔订阅实际到账约为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{net}} = \\frac{P}{1+t} \\times (1-c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在美国这种「税外加收」地区，展示价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 不含税，结账才加 <code>sales tax</code>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{net}} = P \\times (1-c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。两类地区的差别不是财务口径，而是<strong>定价策略</strong>：含税地区把标价从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9.99</mn><mtext>提到</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9.99 提到</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9.99</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">提到</span></span></span></span></span>10.99$，净收入涨幅被税率稀释；价外地区涨的是净价。做全球统一目标净收入时，必须按此反推展示价再吸附到阶梯点。</p>\n<p>佣金本身也分段：标准费率 30%，小企业计划（年收入 &lt; 100 万美元）与<strong>订阅满一年后的自动续订</strong>通常降到 15%（<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/app-store/small-business-program/\">Apple: 小企业计划</a>）。因此长期订阅的边际毛利随订阅月数上升，定价试验要按<strong>订阅账龄分层</strong>看 LTV，而不能只看首月转化。</p>\n<p>各国税率是动态的，必须当作<strong>外部输入注入</strong>而不是硬编码在代码里：日本消费税、欧盟各国 VAT（17%–27% 区间）、英国 VAT、澳大利亚 GST、印度 GST 都会调整，且「数字服务税」与「平台代缴门槛」的适用范围在逐年扩大。工程做法是把税率、佣金率、汇率做成带生效日期的配置表，定价计算读配置而非读常量——这让税率变更可审计、可回放。</p>\n<h2 id=\"老订阅者的价格变更-保价窗口与强制涨价的合规红线\">老订阅者的价格变更：保价窗口与强制涨价的合规红线</h2><p>对于<strong>新用户</strong>改价是纯运营动作，对<strong>已有订阅者</strong>改价则是合规动作，两个平台都设了硬闸门，踩错会直接掉用户和触发退款潮。</p>\n<p>Apple 的规则核心是<strong>涨价幅度分档</strong>：当自动续订价格上涨超过一定阈值时，不能静默生效，必须通知订阅者并获得同意，未同意的用户在当前周期结束后终止；涨幅在阈值以内，或因<strong>法律/税务原因</strong>涨价时，可通知后自动适用（<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/manage-subscriptions/manage-prices-for-existing-subscribers/\">Apple: Manage prices for existing subscribers</a>）。阈值随 storefront 不同（常见 5% 一档），因此<strong>一次全球统一涨价往往在部分国家自动生效、在另一些国家需逐用户确认</strong>，运营必须分地区建模。</p>\n<p>Google Play 的机制类似但语义不同：涨价后现有订阅者会收到通知，通常可享受一段<strong>保价期</strong>（保持原价若干个计费周期）后才切换新价，用户也可选择不接受；降级或降价则对用户友好（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/11698251\">Google Play: 订阅价格变更</a>）。两个平台的「老用户保价」都意味着：<strong>涨价当月的收入不会立刻跳变</strong>，财务预测必须按保价窗口做时间加权。</p>\n<p>工程上要维护一张「价格变更工单」表，字段含目标价、起始价、涨幅、各 storefront 阈值判定结果、是否触发用户确认、保价结束日期。它与 <a href=\"../subscription-lifecycle-entitlement/server-notification-webhook-sync\">服务端通知（ASSN/RTDN）接入与 webhook 幂等处理</a> 里的事件账本是上下游关系——保价到期、用户确认或拒价、订阅终止都会以 <code>DID_CHANGE_RENEWAL_STATUS</code>、<code>PRICE_INCREASE</code> 子类型或 Play 的 <code>SUBSCRIPTION_PRICE_CHANGE_CONFIRMED</code> 等形式回流，服务端必须以<strong>商店最终状态</strong>为准，而不是按工单表里「计划生效日」的假设。</p>\n<h2 id=\"试验定价与-a-b-测试-从付费墙打法到统计判定\">试验定价与 A/B 测试：从付费墙打法到统计判定</h2><p>定价 A/B 测试在 IAP 场景通常不是「给同一商品设两个价」，因为商店价格对同一 <code>productId</code> 是全局的。真正可 A/B 的是<strong>付费墙组合</strong>：把不同价格点、不同套餐结构、不同 trial 长度打包成不同 Offering，再按用户分流。RevenueCat Experiments 直接建在 Offering 层，把用户随机分到 Control / Variant，按转化率、收入、LTV 判定胜出（<a href=\"https://www.revenuecat.com/docs/tools/experiments\">RevenueCat: Experiments</a>）。Google Play 的商店详情页实验与 Apple 的 Product Page Optimization 测试图标、截图、促销文案对<strong>页面转化</strong>的影响，与 App 内付费墙实验是两个独立漏斗（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/6227309\">Google Play: 商店实验</a>）。</p>\n<p>判定胜负需要样本量，而不是「Variant 高了 0.3% 就上线」。对于转化率这类比例指标，达到双侧显著性水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>、检验功效 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>、最小可检测相对提升 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 时，每组所需样本约为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\approx \\frac{2\\,(z_{1-\\alpha/2} + z_{1-\\beta})^2 \\, p(1-p)}{\\delta^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2453em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5593em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7452em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是基线转化率。取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0.05,\\ \\beta=0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.96</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_{1-\\alpha/2}\\approx1.96</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8383em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.84</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_{1-\\beta}\\approx0.84</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7692em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.84</span></span></span></span></span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.03</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=0.03</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.03</span></span></span></span></span>、想检测相对提升 10%（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.003</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta=0.003</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.003</span></span></span></span></span>）可得每组约需上万次曝光——这就是订阅定价实验往往要跑数周、且<strong>中途偷看数据再决定停跑</strong>会显著抬高假阳性的原因。RevenueCat Experiments 用贝叶斯模型给出「Variant 胜过 Control 的概率」，可直接读后验概率而非 p 值，但样本量约束依然成立；跑不够就下结论，等于用噪声定价。</p>\n<p>三个工程陷阱要提前挡住：<strong>汇率与税档污染结果</strong>（判定指标统一用归一化净收入或转化率）、<strong>分流必须稳定互斥</strong>（同一用户重复进入实验落同一组，分流键用服务端稳定匿名 ID）、<strong>周期效应</strong>（年付 LTV 需等一年，短周期只能看首期转化与首月续费）。</p>\n<p>付费墙实验的上游是商品配置的正确性：Offering 与 Entitlement 映射本身错，实验只会放大错误。与 <a href=\"../purchase-flow-receipt-validation/server-receipt-validation-jws\">服务端收据校验与 JWS 验签</a> 的分界是——试验决定「卖多少钱、怎么卖」，验签决定「这笔钱是不是真的到账、权益该不该发」，两者共同构成收入侧闭环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运营治理-把定价当成有版本-可审计的配置\">运营治理：把定价当成有版本、可审计的配置</h2><p>把上面三件事合起来看，跨境定价治理的本质是<strong>把价格当作带生效日期、带地区维度、带审计轨迹的配置数据</strong>，而不是散落在后台和代码里的常量。最小治理基线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>单一价格源</strong>：所有价格先写进自有配置表（基准价、storefront 映射、生效日期、变更工单号），再由任务同步到 App Store Connect / Play Console，禁止手改后台后不同步回配置表。</li>\n<li><strong>变更前置校验</strong>：提交前自动核对涨幅阈值、保价窗口、含税语义、阶梯可达性四项，任一不通过则阻断。</li>\n<li><strong>对账闭环</strong>：商店结算报表（Apple Sales/Trends、Google earnings）与自有收入账本按 <code>transactionId</code>/<code>orderId</code> 对账，汇率损益、退款、保价差额在此暴露。</li>\n<li><strong>可回放</strong>：任何一次定价变更都能从配置表重放出「某天某地区某商品的实际标价」，用于审计与举证。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>价格本地化、税率换算、试验定价三层是递进的：本地化决定「展示什么数字」，税率决定「数字里有多少是你的」，试验决定「这个数字是不是最优」。三者共享同一份配置源，也共享同一个失败模式——<strong>把跨境当成同一种货币、同一套税、同一批用户来运营</strong>。把价格做成带生效日期、地区维度与审计轨迹的配置数据，并与商店报表、服务端事件账本对账，是这条流水线唯一可持续的运营形态。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"价格本地化、税率换算与试验定价/A-B 测试","id":"价格本地化-税率换算与试验定价-a-b-测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：价格阶梯与本地化生成","id":"核心概念-价格阶梯与本地化生成"},{"level":2,"text":"税率换算：谁是代征方，净收入怎么算","id":"税率换算-谁是代征方-净收入怎么算"},{"level":2,"text":"老订阅者的价格变更：保价窗口与强制涨价的合规红线","id":"老订阅者的价格变更-保价窗口与强制涨价的合规红线"},{"level":2,"text":"试验定价与 A/B 测试：从付费墙打法到统计判定","id":"试验定价与-a-b-测试-从付费墙打法到统计判定"},{"level":2,"text":"运营治理：把定价当成有版本、可审计的配置","id":"运营治理-把定价当成有版本-可审计的配置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"订阅欺诈、退款与拒付（chargeback）风控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-in-app-purchase-subscription-revenuecat-engineering/revenue-integrity-price-ops-governance/subscription-fraud-refund-chargeback"},"next":{"title":"收入度量（MRR/续费/流失/LTV）与数据治理合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-in-app-purchase-subscription-revenuecat-engineering/revenue-integrity-price-ops-governance/revenue-metrics-governance"}}